==Notes==
[[File:Alpha_Trion_through_the_epochs.jpg|thumb|upright=2|Once you go white, you'll never, er... be right?]]
* Alpha Trion is one of few Cybertronians to show signs of aging and [[Facial hair|hair growth]].
* Alpha Trion was added to the dialogue of [[Transformers: Robots in Disguise (2001 cartoon)|the 2001 ''Robots in Disguise'' cartoon]] and is not present in the ''[[Transformers: Robots in Disguise (2001 cartoon)#Car Robots|Car Robots]]'' version of the show, with [[Vector Sigma]] instead being said to have directly created [[Optimus Prime (RID)|Fire Convoy]] and [[Ultra Magnus (RID)|God Magnus]].
* In the ''Robots in Disguise'' Italian dub, Alpha Trion is described as [[Female Transformer|female]].
* Alpha Trion had a hover-craft [[alternate mode]] designed for his appearance in ''[[The Transformers: Ironhide]]'', but ultimately didn't end up transforming in that mini-series. The vehicle mode was first revealed in the trade paperback's extras, and would eventually be used in-continuity as part of a flashback sequence in "[[Earthfall Part 3: The Mind Bomb|The Mind Bomb]]" and in the ''[[Transformers Legends (mobile game)|Transformers Legends]]'' episode "[[Megatron Origins]]".
* Alpha Trion's fate in the Aligned continuity family is uncertain; the DVD commentary for "[[Rebellion (Prime)|Rebellion]]" seems to assert that Trion had died at some point before the episode, although this was never mentioned in the show's dialogue itself, leaving it a case of [[authorial intent]]. The ''Covenant of Primus'' has Alpha Trion describing later episodes all the way up to ''[[Predacons Rising (Prime)|Predacons Rising]]'', meaning that he had remained alive or managed to update the Covenant from beyond the grave.
*"Rock Me Alpha Trion" is a reference to the song "{{w|Rock Me Amadeus}}" by {{w|Falco (musician)|Falco}}.
* ''[[Transformers: Cyberverse (franchise)|Cyberverse]]'' Alpha Trion has a design directly inspired by a piece of fanart by [[Makoto Ono]]—[https://makotoono.deviantart.com/art/Alphatrion-362351864 now-deleted] from his deviantART account, but still very much [https://uk.pinterest.com/pin/autobot-leader-alpha-trion-by-makotoonodeviantartcom-on-deviantart--375909900129440770/ floating around online]. [[Circular reporting|Key elements include]] the specific detailing of the lower legs, and the oversized proportions of his shoulder pads, chest armor, and helmet crest.

